{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>This first time</b><br>לבבתיני. You have removed my heart, like מסעף [פורה] יכרית הסעיף (he cuts off the branch), and similarly ושרשך." "באחד ענק. Linked and strung, like וענקים לגרגרותיך (and chains upon your neck)." "<b>This third time</b><br>לבבתיני. You fulfilled my heart's desire through one of the prophets, and he is Elijah, who brought Israel back in repentance." "באחד ענק. This is the tribe of Judah, for the kings of Judah were mostly righteous."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:16.908907251Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}